+//
+// Fast variant of gated_delta_net_q8 for the default MQ4/HFQ4 path.
+// Supports EF residual (sigma-delta) but always does single-end requant
+// OUTSIDE the per-token loop. No per-token requant mode.
+//
+// VARIANT R16c3 gdn_vrow_bcast:
+// BOD: mem-active(mixed) occ~17% mem_busy~33% L2~86% vgpr=64 LDS=2048.
+// The four v rows are wave-uniform, but the baseline issues the same float4
+// load from every lane.  On gfx12, load it in lane 0 and broadcast the four
+// exact FP32 bit patterns.  All recurrence math and reduction order remain
+// unchanged; non-gfx12 preprocessing is byte-identical to the baseline.
 
