I found one untried, mechanism-backed niche: prefetch only the four current-row group-0 weight lines before the existing x-hoist. Unlike dead next-quad and group-1 prefetches, this targets the first-demand miss window (24.2% L2 misses) and overlaps it with the four `float4` x loads, without extending packed-weight VGPR live ranges. It will be gated to gfx12 so other fleet architectures compile identically.
