88:R28c3_rms_dpp_quad12 kernel=fused_rmsnorm_mq_rotate lever=rms_dpp_quad12 verdict=DEAD delta_pct=0.31 f=0.625 learned=Gfx12 DPP quad-permute for the XOR-1/XOR-2 FWHT stages passed exact parity but raised VGPR 48->56 while occupancy remained structurally catastrophic at 0.2% (wall 4.2%, L2 71.1%, mem_busy 17.8%); lower-latency DPP does not shorten this one-block critical path because its codegen adds peak live state, so this kernel needs a register-neutral latency lever or launch-level parallelism.
