94:R22c2_rms_fwht_stage_gather kernel=fused_rmsnorm_mq_rotate lever=rms_fwht_stage_gather verdict=INCONCLUSIVE delta_pct=0.88 f=0.699 learned=Gathering all eight FWHT cross-lane peers before consuming them kept VGPR at 48 but occupancy at 0.2%; the K=2048 one-block grid remains structurally underoccupied, and intra-wave ds-swizzle MLP was not a decisive decode lever.
102:R21c1_rms_p1a_mid_pref kernel=fused_rmsnorm_mq_rotate lever=rms_p1a_mid_pref verdict=DEAD delta_pct=0.32 f=0.625 learned=Midpoint x/weight prefetch raised VGPR 48->56 and dropped occupancy 0.2->0.1%; this single-block RMS/FWHT kernel is structurally under-occupied, so extra live prefetch state overwhelms the latency-overlap benefit.
